essions.session", "pk": "bimodrcmasdaz0pn33os97oj6kd7rp74", "fields": {"session_data": ".eJxVjEEOwiAQRe_C2hBgAhSX7j0DmRlGqRqalHZlvLtt0oVu33v_v1XGdal57TLnsaizcur0ywj5KW0X5YHtPmme2jKPpPdEH7br61TkdTnav4OKvW5rwRsMASh6awUTG-dTAiLjo3cbCwwBAUl4iIU5JgtAxjoLBS2JUZ8v1PU3gQ:1wGJZb:JnflFRSNGaMurvCt3ZcFOQYx7jRqmY99P9OVXjpH0Bw", "expire_date": "2026-05-08T16:40:11.931Z"}}, {"model": "sessions.session", "pk": "mr2d5yx8blpsb623h1zfuzns474rcmvq", "fields": {"session_data": ".eJxVjEEOwiAQRe_C2hBgAhSX7j0DmRlGqRqalHZlvLtt0oVu33v_v1XGdal57TLnsaizcur0ywj5KW0X5YHtPmme2jKPpPdEH7br61TkdTnav4OKvW5rwRsMASh6awUTG-dTAiLjo3cbCwwBAUl4iIU5JgtAxjoLBS2JUZ8v1PU3gQ:1w84PH:V08YMnMNO-d1JdfIxdq7rjDmklc8J4kXamAEtAL5ZBk", "expire_date": "2026-04-15T22:51:27.498Z"}}, {"model": "blog.category", "pk": 1, "fields": {"name": "Tech Blogs", "slug": "tech-blogs"}}, {"model": "blog.category", "pk": 2, "fields": {"name": "Introductions", "slug": "introductions"}}, {"model": "blog.post", "pk": 1, "fields": {"status": "P", "publish_date": null, "title": "A Fresh Take on Tech: Launching My Creative Dev Blog", "content": "<p><strong>There&rsquo;s something magical about pressing &ldquo;publish&rdquo; for the first time.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It&rsquo;s a quiet click, really. But in that moment, something shifts. A space you&rsquo;ve been building in the shadows suddenly opens its doors. And you realize&mdash;this isn&rsquo;t just a website. It&rsquo;s an invitation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, welcome. 👋 I&rsquo;m so glad you&rsquo;re here.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>This isn&rsquo;t just another tech blog</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let&rsquo;s be honest: the internet is noisy. There are tutorials everywhere, opinions stacked on opinions, and a constant hum of &ldquo;look at me.&rdquo; I didn&rsquo;t want to add to the noise. I wanted to create something different.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A place where&nbsp;<strong>code meets creativity</strong>.<br />\r\nWhere pixels have personality.<br />\r\nWhere the journey matters just as much as the destination.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you&rsquo;ve ever felt like the tech world could use a little more heart, a little more story, and a lot more warmth&hellip; you&rsquo;re in the right spot.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>The story behind the screen</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I&rsquo;m a developer, yes. But I&rsquo;m also a writer, a dreamer, and someone who believes that the best digital experiences feel human.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I built this blog with Django (a powerful framework that I&rsquo;ll tell you about soon), designed it with Tailwind CSS, and poured my own aesthetic into every corner. The soft colors? That&rsquo;s me. The clean lines? Also me. The little details you&rsquo;ll notice as you click around? That&rsquo;s what happens when you build something with love.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This blog is a living portfolio of my skills, but more than that&mdash;it&rsquo;s a reflection of how I see the world. Organized, but creative. Logical, but expressive. Technical, but always human.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>What you can expect</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here&rsquo;s what I&rsquo;ll be sharing with you:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✨&nbsp;<strong>Behind‑the‑scenes of my coding projects</strong><br />\r\nNot just the finished product, but the messy middle&mdash;the bugs, the breakthroughs, the lessons learned.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✨&nbsp;<strong>Design thoughts &amp; tech inspiration</strong><br />\r\nBecause good code deserves good design, and great ideas often come from unexpected places.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✨&nbsp;<strong>Tips for developers who want to build with personality</strong><br />\r\nWhether you&rsquo;re starting your first blog or your tenth, I&rsquo;ll share what I&rsquo;ve learned about making things that feel authentic.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>✨&nbsp;<strong>Personal stories</strong><br />\r\nBecause I believe the best creators share more than code&mdash;they share themselves.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>Why this matters (and why you should care)</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The internet is overflowing with information, but connection is rare.<br />\r\nI&rsquo;m not here to teach you how to copy‑paste a terminal command.<br />\r\nI&rsquo;m here to invite you into a space where we build&mdash;together.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Maybe you&rsquo;re a developer looking for a little inspiration.<br />\r\nMaybe you&rsquo;re curious about what goes into creating a site like this.<br />\r\nOr maybe you just stumbled in and liked the colors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whatever brought you here, you belong.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<h2>A little invitation</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This first post is a door opening.<br />\r\nBut a door is only special when someone walks through it.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So here&rsquo;s my ask:&nbsp;<strong>stay a while.</strong><br />\r\nRead the next post. Leave a comment. Share what you&rsquo;re building.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let&rsquo;s make the internet a little more intentional, one pixel at a time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Thanks for being here.</strong><br />\r\nI can&rsquo;t wait to see what we create together.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&mdash;&nbsp;<em>Gracious</em>&nbsp;🌸</p>", "image": "image/upload/post_images/tech.webp", "author": 2, "created_at": "2026-04-01T15:47:19Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-24T16:43:40.754Z", "category": 2, "deleted": false, "deleted_at": null, "likes": [1, 2]}}, {"model": "blog.profile", "pk": 1, "fields": {"user": 1, "avatar": null, "bio": ""}}, {"model": "blog.profile", "pk": 2, "fields": {"user": 2, "avatar": "image/upload/avatars/IMG_2065.jpeg", "bio": "A web developer"}}, {"model": "taggit.tag", "pk": 1, "fields": {"name": "Django-blog", "slug": "django-blog"}}, {"model": "taggit.tag", "pk": 2, "fields": {"name": "First blog post", "slug": "first-blog-post"}}, {"model": "taggit.tag", "pk": 3, "fields": {"name": "blog launch", "slug": "blog-launch"}}, {"model": "taggit.tag", "pk": 4, "fields": {"name": "creative coding", "slug": "creative-coding"}}, {"model": "taggit.tag", "pk": 5, "fields": {"name": "design meets code", "slug": "design-meets-code"}}, {"model": "taggit.tag", "pk": 6, "fields": {"name": "developer journey", "slug": "developer-journey"}}]
